# In this club's model, every core member can review/merge any repo, so the
# whole `core` team is the code owner. (A team owner must have write access to
# the repo and the team must be visible to the repo.)

# Default owner for everything in the repo: the core team.
*                       @ScalerOpenSourceLabsOrg/core

# Security-critical or governance files — still owned by core, called out so
# reviewers know to look carefully.
/src/engine/            @ScalerOpenSourceLabsOrg/core
/GOVERNANCE.md          @ScalerOpenSourceLabsOrg/core
/SECURITY.md            @ScalerOpenSourceLabsOrg/core
/MAINTAINERS.md         @ScalerOpenSourceLabsOrg/core
